message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "benchling-agent"
version: 0.2.0
date-released: "2026-11-18"
abstract: >-
  A preview-then-apply CLI and read-only-by-default MCP server that puts an
  auditable layer between an AI agent and a Benchling electronic lab notebook.
  Changes are first recorded as immutable, checksummed plans with version
  preconditions; a separate apply step re-checks those preconditions and
  writes an execution journal. Unofficial; not affiliated with or endorsed
  by Benchling, Inc.
authors:
